  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that using scvi_n200 RNA encoder with resnet50 image encoder (config_031) achieves the highest accuracy so far (0.6776). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l image encoder while keeping scvi_n200 RNA encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion (same as config_031). This isolates the impact of the image encoder choice, which is critical for multimodal performance. It balances exploitation (building on the successful scvi_n200 RNA encoder) and exploration (testing a stronger image encoder)."
}

